\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Blesssed assurance, Jesus is mine:
\par O what a foretaste of glory divine!
\par Heir of salvation, purchase of God;
\par Born of His Spirit, washed in His blood.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par This is my story, this is my song,
\par Praising my Saviour all the day long.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Perfect submission, perfect delight,
\par Visions of rapture burst on my sight;
\par Angels descending, bring from above
\par Echoes of mercy, whispers of love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par This is my story, this is my song,
\par Praising my Saviour all the day long.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Perfect submission, all is at rest,
\par I in my Saviour am happy and blest;
\par Watching and waiting, looking above,
\par Filled with His goodness, lost in His love. 
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Chorus\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par This is my story, this is my song,
\par Praising my Saviour all the day long.
\par \f1 
